Sector status is determined by comparing the quarter's sector with
the reference contract's sector.

Employment is determined by the \code{arco} variable where:
\itemize{
\item \code{arco = 0}: Indicates unemployment (not working)
\item \code{arco > 0}: Indicates employment (working)
